se,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EOgh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4055c8ec-b73f-4842-ac30-17ecd4f86326","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"自分はこういう RPC する処理を書くときは\n```type PlainObject = {\n  [k: string]: PlainObject;\n  [k: number]: PlainObject;\n} | PlainObject[]\n  | boolean\n  | string\n  | number\n  | null;```","ts":"1626137218.284800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BjZ7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99932740-26c4-4542-97ce-343c942e5611","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あとは、denops.call の型定義的にも省いておいたほうがいいですね。","ts":"1626137091.284000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NIAQR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f7f7317-0605-4228-82dc-b55c3b3c4231","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あとはこの恐らくは公開しないであろう関数をどこに置くか","ts":"1626136860.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UKPm+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10620fb0-b24b-4b50-991d-b07d99338dae","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":tashikani:","ts":"1626136857.283600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U=p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f67dc966-d262-4009-a66a-46e82df18ad3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ですよね、多分undefinedをバッサリ切り落とすだけでいいはず","ts":"1626136831.283100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4vxkV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb3afd26-1248-4790-8046-ff816b2d2053","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"vim scriptは真ん中だけoptionalは存在しないはず…","ts":"1626136815.282700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hh3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d878bde7-90a9-4948-8f14-56808760db93","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"真ん中だけoptionalっていうのは多分ないはず……？\nTSだとまずないと思うんですけど、Vim scriptだと仕様的に存在するんだろうか","ts":"1626136793.282200","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1626136799.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0J2EJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"935e0661-2c7a-4095-8fb5-48ea825bdedc","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"引数の真ん中がオプションな関数以外ならそれで割とスマートな定義にできそうですね","ts":"1626136734.281200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p5yW9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3ea45fc-d78c-4368-8b02-7dffa25b05dd","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ですね、可変長引数を受け取ってundefinedをカットして返す関数があれば楽になりそう","ts":"1626136475.279800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RVN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"65e4c7af-0c78-4037-b91f-06b2bad0e87c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"配列にして undefined だけフィルタすればいいってことですかね？","ts":"1626136392.278700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3k7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2febeea3-2243-4ce5-8d62-3e20b660a778","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"optional 引数向けのヘルパを作れば簡素にはできなくはないかもしれない","ts":"1626136382.278000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n=VH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbe3f6b9-5d59-404e-a341-d52ccf60c185","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"正確には実装見に行って、unknownのarray（可変長引数）を投げてたのでこれは判定ダルいなと思って投げたんだった","ts":"1626135769.277100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vp4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc0bfa07-9643-4e11-990c-f6cfebe1ac55","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"callの中身（たぶんcore側）でundefinedを切るって実装も考えたんですが、内部インターフェースが分からないのでとりあえず諦めた","ts":"1626135645.276100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"elv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96723b54-7e78-4425-b852-d22bef504d7d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"colがundefinedのとき\n```denops.call(\"cursor\", lnumOrList, col)```\nって実行できないので、判定処理が必要でそれをもっとスマートにできたら嬉しいなって感じかなと","ts":"1626135433.275500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hAKn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a45b126-cc39-455b-8671-8a1cbd88e703","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"この部分をもっとシンプルに書けないか\nという話しの認識です","ts":"1626135364.274500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AMp6h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e3f92c4-4a18-45f6-9f7f-06a8e30b89ba","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```  if (col == undefined) {\n    return await denops.call(\"cursor\", lnumOrList) as number;\n  } else if (off == undefined) {\n    return await denops.call(\"cursor\", lnumOrList, col) as number;\n  } else {\n    return await denops.call(\"cursor\", lnumOrList, col, off) as number;\n  }```","ts":"1626135341.273900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fB7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cd8698f-cd15-4b0c-9232-ae6128673ee1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"nullableの数だけifが冗長になるって話であっていますか？","ts":"1626135029.273600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QJE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8633bcf3-a7fe-4525-8781-dda53f7cb652","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"上のを見てもよく分かってない・・・","ts":"1626134798.273200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ph"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DCE2D4C1-199C-4FBC-8C15-1DEE7A7178AA","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"同じく良い書き方ないかなって悩んでたやつ","ts":"1626134740.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S4A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13375ff5-de8c-458e-9a9f-368163e1bda1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"1つ、JSで関数定義して型だけ別に書くという方法もあるけどこれはできればやりたくない","ts":"1626132049.272500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H/bAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b57bbad3-275f-4f8e-b741-6f910ae25f85","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Optionalなやつ意外と多いので一々これをやるのもなあという","ts":"1626131859.271900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"emz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98a0ea7d-1793-4ece-8844-b0ae65d2245e","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"思った！複数オプショナルな場合になんだかなぁ……と…。良い書き方ないんかな","ts":"1626131831.271500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pDzl+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f12871cd-5739-4131-9550-33b76b171320","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ライセンス的な問題がなければ良いです〜","ts":"1626145934.339500","thread_ts":"1626144951.334300","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c+y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4edef3f4-e094-4e87-93bd-a9e0d4b4466e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"たぶんありそうだと思ってます","ts":"1626145945.339700","thread_ts":"1626144951.334300","parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0W8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e6a55d9-2ab9-455b-966b-2db19c680a41","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"フリー版の利用規約は割と緩めな気がしています。\n\u003chttps://www.deepl.com/ja/pro-license#free\u003e","ts":"1626146465.344500","thread_ts":"1626144951.334300","attachments":[{"fallback":"DeepL – Terms \u0026amp; conditions","id":1,"title":"DeepL – Terms \u0026amp; conditions","title_link":"https://www.deepl.com/ja/pro-license#free","text":"translatorDescription_1","blocks":null,"service_name":"deepl.com","service_icon":"https://www.deepl.com/img/favicon/favicon_16.png","from_url":"https://www.deepl.com/ja/pro-license#free","original_url":"https://www.deepl.com/ja/pro-license#free"}],"parent_user_id":"UL6CFN8NR","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"69b9bbe795f19442","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T7jL0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5ede597-06f1-45a1-9722-9f1234b117c1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/80\u003e\n\nで `denops#api#id(...)` 関数を足すことにしました","ts":"1626141370.326800","thread_ts":"1626139033.309200","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/80|#80 :+1:  Drop arguments after `undefined` for convenience\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/pull/80|#80 :+1:  Drop arguments after `undefined` for convenience\u003e","text":"Now arguments after `undefined` in `call` or `batch` are dropped for convenience like:\n\n```\ntest({\n  mode: \"all\",\n  name:\n    \"denops.call() drop arguments after `undefined` (but `null`) for convenience\",\n  fn: async (denops) =\u0026gt; {\n    assertEquals(\n      await denops.call(\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, 2),\n      [0, 1, 2],\n    );\n    assertEquals(\n      await denops.call(\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, undefined, 2),\n      [0, 1],\n    );\n    assertEquals(\n      await denops.call(\"denops#api#id\", 0, undefined, 1, 2),\n      [0],\n    );\n    assertEquals(\n      await denops.call(\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, null, 2),\n      [0, 1, null, 2],\n    );\n    assertEquals(\n      await denops.call(\"denops#api#id\", 0, null, 1, 2),\n      [0, null, 1, 2],\n    );\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```\ntest({\n  mode: \"all\",\n  name:\n    \"denops.batch() drop arguments after `undefined` (but `null`) for convenience\",\n  fn: async (denops) =\u0026gt; {\n    const results = await denops.batch(\n      [\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, 2],\n      [\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, undefined, 2],\n      [\"denops#api#id\", 0, undefined, 1, 2],\n      [\"denops#api#id\", 0, 1, null, 2],\n      [\"denops#api#id\", 0, null, 1, 2],\n    );\n    assertEquals(results, [[0, 1, 2], [0, 1], [0], [0, 1, null, 2], [\n      0,\n      null,\n      1,\n      2,\n    ]]);\n  },\n});\n```","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"enhancement","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1626140264}],"parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PUg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25e04e87-6f56-4382-a73d-c44a8c620234","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なるほど、こういうのいいですね","ts":"1626141597.327100","thread_ts":"1626139033.309200","parent_user_id":"U01D44KSY9Z","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vvdM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51f07cba-3b6b-45ce-8c17-c7914eaea19a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(型検査だけ固定引数で実体は可変長みたいなのやりたい…)","ts":"1626131705.270300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vp+Lu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ca6629a-e5a4-41f2-ab0d-55d115ab95bd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"オーバーロードの最後を可変長引数にするのも合法でない引数を受け取るようになりますよね(考えすぎ？)","ts":"1626131645.269700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Ger"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d73adadf-f14e-4f8a-8b8c-b8a526325e48","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"一応JSのargumentsをArrayにしてsliceするとか考えたんですが、argumentsを使うこと自体もにょるし無駄にArray作るのもなあというお気持ちです","ts":"1626131488.268900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete